&lt;p&gt;We also have the output &lt;code&gt;output.txt&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Format muscle</title><link>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/crewctf/format-muscle/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/crewctf/format-muscle/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This challenge was made by me for CrewCTF 2024 as a member of &lt;a target="_blank" href="https://ctftime.org/team/85618"&gt;thehackerscrew&lt;/a&gt;. We are given a binary called &lt;code&gt;format-muscle&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
