&lt;h2 id="reverse-engineering"&gt;Reverse engineering&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The reverse-engineering step is quite simple. This is the original C code:&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-container" style="position: relative;"&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" data-pagefind-ignore="all"&gt;
 &lt;code class="ma0 pa0 white"&gt;
 &lt;pre class="ccode" tabindex="0"&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;#include&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;&amp;lt;stdio.h&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;#include&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;&amp;lt;stdlib.h&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;#include&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;&amp;lt;string.h&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;() {&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;char&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; data[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;256&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;setbuf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(stdout, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;fgets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(data, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;sizeof&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(data), stdin);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;printf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(data);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; } &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;while&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;strncmp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(data, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;"quit"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;));&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;exit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
 &lt;/code&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;button class="copy-code-btn" aria-label="Copy code"&gt;
 &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-copy"&gt;&lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"&gt;&lt;/rect&gt;&lt;path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id="format-string-vulnerability"&gt;Format String vulnerability&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As can be seen, we have a &lt;code&gt;do&lt;/code&gt;-&lt;code&gt;while&lt;/code&gt; loop that allows us to enter data in a buffer that will be printed out with &lt;code&gt;printf&lt;/code&gt;, as the first argument. So, we have a clear Format String vulnerability:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>po1337nomial</title><link>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/crewctf/po1337nomial/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/crewctf/po1337nomial/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This challenge was made by me for CrewCTF 2025 as a member of &lt;a target="_blank" href="https://ctftime.org/team/85618"&gt;thehackerscrew&lt;/a&gt;. It was supposed to be an easy Crypto challenge, and ended with 35 solves. Therefore, even if easy, LLMs were not able to solve the challenge directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are provided with the Python source code of the server that contains the flag:&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-container" style="position: relative;"&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" data-pagefind-ignore="all"&gt;
 &lt;code class="ma0 pa0 white"&gt;
 &lt;pre class="ccode" tabindex="0"&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk3"&gt;#!/usr/bin/env python3&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;os&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;getenv&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;random&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;getrandbits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;randbytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;randrange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;shuffle&lt;/span&gt;


&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;FLAG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;getenv&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'FLAG'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'crew&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;{fake_flag}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;getrandbits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;32&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;1337&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'1'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'Get coefficients'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'2'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'Evaluate'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'3'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'Unlock flag'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;while&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;''&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;join&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk7 mtki"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;\n{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;()) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;\n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;&amp;gt; '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;break&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;pop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'1'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;shuffle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;copy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'s:'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'2'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'x: '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;randrange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;1337&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;1337&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'y:'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;sum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;a_i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;a_i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;enumerate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)))&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'3'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'k: '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;randbytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk6"&gt;1337&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;hex&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;():&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;FLAG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
 &lt;/code&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
