&lt;h2 id="source-code-analysis"&gt;Source code analysis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The code is short and easy to follow. In brief, the server creates $1337$ coefficients for a polynomial:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Read between the lines</title><link>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/crewctf/read-between-the-lines/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/crewctf/read-between-the-lines/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This challenge was made by me for CrewCTF 2024 as a member of &lt;a target="_blank" href="https://ctftime.org/team/85618"&gt;thehackerscrew&lt;/a&gt;. We are provided with the Python source code to encrypt the flag:&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-container" style="position: relative;"&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" data-pagefind-ignore="all"&gt;
 &lt;code class="ma0 pa0 white"&gt;
 &lt;pre class="ccode" tabindex="0"&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk3"&gt;#!/usr/bin/env python3&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;random&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;shuffle&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;Crypto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;Util&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8 mtku"&gt;number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;getPrime&lt;/span&gt;


&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk8"&gt;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'flag.txt'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk4"&gt;'rb'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk5"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mtk1"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
